<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Tu contrase&ntilde;a temporal de Monea</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #000000;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #000000;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 48px 16px 40px;">

          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width: 520px;">
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding: 0 0 28px;">
                {{#if hasLogo}}
                <img src="cid:{{logoCid}}" alt="Monea" width="96" height="96" style="display: block; width: 96px; height: 96px; object-fit: contain;" />
                {{else}}
                <div style="display: inline-block; color: #ff2fa0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 6px;">MONEA</div>
                {{/if}}
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding: 0 0 8px;">
                <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.3px;">Recupera tu cuenta</h1>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding: 0 24px 36px;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #9b9b9b; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">Hola {{name}}, generamos esta contrase&ntilde;a temporal para que entres de nuevo a tu cuenta.</p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0 0 24px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="background-color: #0a0a0a; border: 1px solid #242424; border-radius: 12px; padding: 30px 16px;">
                      <p style="margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ff2fa0; font-weight: 700;">Contrase&ntilde;a temporal</p>
                      <div style="font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 7px; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;">{{temporaryPassword}}</div>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0 8px 40px;">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; color: #7a7a7a;">
                  Al entrar con esta contrase&ntilde;a, la app te pedir&aacute; crear una nueva. Hazlo lo antes posible.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width: 520px; border-top: 1px solid #1c1c1c;">
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding: 28px 0 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #ff2fa0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 4px;">MONEA</p>
                <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; color: #6d6d6d; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">Nunca compartas tu contrase&ntilde;a con nadie. &copy; {{year}} Monea</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
